{"id":"easy-009","difficulty":"easy","title":"判断全正数","description":"判断列表是否全严格大于 0。空列表 True。","function_signature":"def all_positive(nums: list) -> bool","entry_point":"all_positive","constraints":"0 <= len(nums) <= 10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["空列表","含零"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[1,2,3]],"expected":true},{"args":[[1,0,2]],"expected":false},{"args":[[]],"expected":true}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[-1]],"expected":false},{"args":[[1,1]],"expected":true}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"all(x>0)。","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"空列表 True。","代码实现":"```python\ndef all_positive(nums: list) -> bool:\n    return all(x > 0 for x in nums)\n```","自测说明":"公开用例通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}